  "_comment": "CI4 golden vectors for `~/.config/meeting-pipe/glossary.toml` resolution (ASR1, edited in-app since FEAT11). Generated by scripts/gen_contract_fixtures.py from glossary.load_glossary; do not hand-edit. `terms` is what the pipeline would apply at finalize, keyed by the lower-cased 'as heard' form; Swift's GlossaryStore.resolvedTerms must produce the same map, including the skip rules, so the Vocabulary editor cannot promise a substitution the pipeline will not make. A case with `meta` and `workflows` resolves its workflow through the sidecar's id (WF11, Swift WorkflowIdentity.currentName) instead of `workflow`. `fuzzy_*` is pinned because the editor must leave that section untouched on a write.",
